OL,3,GNEWSARetail group welcomes UK bargain
OL,4,Astore opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Bargains could "contribute
OL,7,Fpositively" to The Bridge when it opens
OL,8,Fits first Guernsey store on Saturday, a
OL,9,Fretail group has said.
OL,11,FThe UK discount chain has invested #10m
OL,12,Fin the former Quayside site on
OL,13,FNorthside and created more than 80
OL,14,Fjobs.
OL,16,FThe Guernsey Retail Group said there
OL,17,Fhad been strong interest in the opening
OL,18,Ffrom shoppers and neighbouring
OL,19,Fbusinesses.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
