OL,3,GNEWSARetail group welcomes UK bargain
OL,4,Astore opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Clayton, the group's retail
OL,7,Fliaison officer, said the arrival of
OL,8,Fthe chain would increase competition
OL,9,Fbut could also bring more shoppers to
OL,10,Fnearby independent retailers.
